<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African kills his three children, then himself.</title>
<headline>S.African kills his three children, then himself.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South African shot dead his three children on Monday then committed suicide, police said.</p>
<p>They said Ivan du Plessis, 45, was found dead in his home east of Johannesburg along with the bodies of his two daughters and a son. His wife was at work at the time.</p>
<p>There was no immediate explanation for the killings, police said.</p>
